1 NOTE Level overflow test file.
2 CONT Original work for issue #301. The GEDCOM level field is at most two
2 CONT digits, so 99 is the deepest valid level. Both the level 100 and the
2 CONT level 101 line below exceed that ceiling and are rejected outright
2 CONT with an INVALID_LEVEL diagnostic (issue #379).
0 @I1@ INDI
1 NAME Level /Overflow/
